@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft YaHei"
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor #4A6FA5
  ActorBorderColor #4A6FA5
  LifeLineBorderColor #4A6FA5
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #F7F9FC
  ParticipantBorderColor #4A6FA5
}
title 图 9 序列图：报名与并发抢最后 1 个名额
autonumber

actor "参与者 A" as PA
actor "参与者 B" as PB
participant "Web / UI" as Web
participant "RegistrationService" as RS
participant "IdempotencyStore" as Idem
participant "SeatInventoryPort" as INV
participant "RegistrationRepository" as Repo
participant "OutboxPort" as Out
participant "NotificationService" as Noti

PA -> Web : 提交报名（Idempotency-Key）
Web -> RS : register(cmd, actor)
RS -> Idem : get(actor.user_id, "register", key)
Idem --> RS : miss
RS -> RS : 权限 / 截止 / 黑名单校验
RS -> INV : claim(session, ticket_type, now)
note over INV
  单条条件更新：
  UPDATE ... WHERE booked_count < capacity
  rowcount = 1 才成功；并发下数据库串行化
end note
INV --> RS : SeatClaim(GRANTED, seat_no = 100)
RS -> Repo : add(REGISTERED)
RS -> Out : enqueue(RegistrationConfirmed)
RS --> Web : 报名成功（座位号 100）
Web --> PA : 显示票证二维码

PB -> Web : 同时提交报名
Web -> RS : register(cmd, actor)
RS -> INV : claim(session, ticket_type, now)
INV --> RS : SeatClaim(WAITLISTED, waitlist_no = 1)
RS -> Repo : add(WAITLISTED, payment_status = PAID)
RS -> Out : enqueue(RegistrationWaitlisted)
RS --> Web : 已进入候补，序号 1
Web --> PB : 显示候补状态

note over INV
  10 个并发请求抢最后 1 个名额：
  1 条 rowcount=1 → REGISTERED；
  其余 9 条 → WAITLISTED（或提示失败）。
  唯一索引 (session_id, participant_id) 防重复。
end note

Out -> Noti : relay_outbox → handle_event
Noti -> Noti : 按 NotificationType 生成消息\n并检查 dedupe_key
Noti --> PA : 站内消息：报名成功
Noti --> PB : 站内消息：已进入候补
@enduml
